            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "নার্সটি শিশুদের টিকা দিলেন। nārsṭi shishuder ṭikā dilen. The nurse vaccinated the children."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "টিকা (ṭikā) দেওয়া, to vaccinate; টিকা (ṭikā) নেওয়া, to be vaccinated."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "টিকা (ṭikā) is ṭikā, \"a mark\", which CDIAL lists for Bengali under a reconstructed form (CDIAL 5458); the vaccination sense probably comes from the mark it leaves on the skin."
            }
          ]
